---
description: TMX project rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Next.js 16 App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind v4 (CSS-first), GSAP+ScrollTrigger, Lenis, Framer Motion, R3F. Installs need --legacy-peer-deps.
- No hardcoded user-facing text: every string goes through i18n (DE default, EN secondary).
- GSAP: always gsap.context() or useGSAP with cleanup. Respect useReducedMotion. 3D via next/dynamic ssr:false.
- No third-party requests on page load (no CDNs, no Google Fonts).
- Never invent company facts, stats, references or legal values. Use src/config/company.ts placeholders.
- Legal texts are copied verbatim from docs/legal/. Never rephrase them.
- Touch only files listed in the task scope. One small change per commit.
- Commit locally only. NEVER git push, never force anything, unless the user explicitly says so.
- If a command fails twice the same way, stop and report instead of retrying.
- Be concise: no summaries or explanations unless asked.